  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5402.03 Failure to Comply with Statute or Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5402.03 Failure to Comply with Statute or Rule.\n\n(a) In the event an applicant fails to comply with RSA 376-A and these rules, the application shall be denied.\n\n(b) The applicant shall be notified of the reason(s) for the denial.\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5400.html"
